scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

let a = 1

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

let b = a

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

let c = b

----------
scriptunit-fragment 4
----------

let d = c

----------
scriptunit-fragment 5
----------

let e = d + 1

----------
expect all five units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `a` moved |
| 2 | takes `a` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `b` moved |
| 3 | takes `b` (2) | compiles, runs | new | `c` moved |
| 4 | takes `c` (3) | compiles, runs | new | `d` = 1 |
| 5 | reads `d` (4) | compiles, runs | new | `e` = 2 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 4
----------

let d = c
let note = 0

----------
expect unit 4, at the end of the chain, is edited
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 2 reruns and takes `a` | `a` moved |
| 2 | takes `a` (1) | reruns | rerun: unit 3 reruns and takes `b` | `b` moved |
| 3 | takes `b` (2) | reruns | rerun: unit 4 takes `c`, which it took when it last ran | `c` moved |
| 4 | takes `c` (3) | recompiles, runs | edited | `d` = 1, `note` = 0 |
| 5 | reads `d` (4) | reruns | reads `d` from unit 4 | `e` = 2 |

